</span>
<strong class="marhaba-connect default-transition text-lightBlack font-inter dark:text-trustWhite text-mobileBodyMedium leading-mobileBodyMedium tablet:text-desktopBodyMedium tablet:leading-desktopBodyMedium block font-[600]">Jen</strong>
<p class="marhaba-connect default-transition text-lightBlack font-inter dark:text-trustWhite text-mobileBodyMedium leading-mobileBodyMedium tablet:text-desktopBodyMedium tablet:leading-desktopBodyMedium">Secure your private keys like your life depends on it. #DoNotShare 🔑</p>
<li class="marhaba-connect min-w-[150px] tablet:min-w-[375px] desktop:min-w-[unset] desktop:flex-1">
<span data-blue=false class="marhaba-connect relative mb-5 inline-block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] data-[blue=true]:before:absolute data-[blue=true]:before:inset-0 data-[blue=true]:before:z-10 data-[blue=true]:before:bg-trustBlue data-[blue=true]:before:opacity-80 data-[blue=true]:before:mix-blend-screen">
